## How this campaign runs

This is an autonomous research loop. The agent re-reads [`docs/program.md`](docs/program.md) every
iteration and: hypothesizes a change to one lever, predicts the metric, runs it, evaluates the frozen
metric + guardrail, logs a scoreboard row, and graduates confirmed findings to `DISCOVERIES.md` only
after independent verification. Experiments are numbered `exp000` (the baseline gate), `exp001` (first
method), then `exp002`, `exp003`, … — zero-padded to three digits so they sort correctly.

- **The loop / charter:** [`docs/program.md`](docs/program.md)
- **Conventions & units (bug-prevention reference):** [`docs/CONVENTIONS.md`](docs/CONVENTIONS.md)
- **Scoreboard (ledger):** [`results/scoreboard.tsv`](results/scoreboard.tsv)
- **Working memory / settled findings:** [`results/JOURNAL.md`](results/JOURNAL.md) · [`results/DISCOVERIES.md`](results/DISCOVERIES.md)

